@startuml
title Cloud-Only Open -> Demand Hydration
actor User
participant Application as App
participant FUSE as Fuse
database "Item DB" as DB
participant "Existing sync/download engine" as Engine
cloud "Microsoft Graph" as Graph
participant "Physical sync_dir" as Disk

User -> App : open/read file
App -> Fuse : content-requiring operation
Fuse -> DB : resolve item + stable hydration state
DB --> Fuse : exists; CLOUD_ONLY

Fuse -> Engine : request hydration(item identity)
note right of Engine
Transient "hydrating" coordination may be
in memory or persisted if crash recovery
requires it. It is not the stable hydrated state.
end note
Engine -> Graph : existing download request
Graph --> Engine : content stream
Engine -> Disk : existing safe temporary/download path
Engine -> Engine : validate completed content
Engine -> Disk : atomically materialise final backing file
Engine -> DB : commit HYDRATED
DB --> Engine : committed
Engine --> Fuse : hydration complete
Fuse -> Disk : open/read backing content
Disk --> Fuse : bytes
Fuse --> App : success
@enduml
